WEBVTT

00:02:58.865 --> 00:03:00.300
kufanya kazi

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:01.952
ilikuwa ni pale binti aitwaye Amy Meyer,

00:03:01.952 --> 00:03:03.565
alipoona ng'ombe mgonjwa akiwa anahamishwa

00:03:03.565 --> 00:03:06.114
na tingatinga nje ya nyumba ya kuchinjia

00:03:06.114 --> 00:03:08.528
alipokuwa mtaani

00:03:08.528 --> 00:03:10.739
amy alifanya kile ambacho wengi wetu wangefanya:

00:03:10.739 --> 00:03:12.514
alipiga video.

00:03:12.514 --> 00:03:15.563
Nilipogundua habari,niliiandika

00:03:15.563 --> 00:03:18.488
Ndani ya masaa 24, ikaleta rabsha

00:03:18.488 --> 00:03:21.738
iliyosababisha mashtaka yote kufutwa.

00:03:21.738 --> 00:03:23.756
Lakini, hata kufichua mambo kama hayo

00:03:23.756 --> 00:03:25.576
ni tishio.

00:03:25.576 --> 00:03:27.240
Kupitia sheria ya uhuru wa mawasiliano

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:29.100
Niligundua kuwa kitengo cha kudhibiti ugaidi

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:31.177
kimekuwa kikifuatilia makala zangu